# expect.stdout: 55\n
# expect.exit: 0
project AccumulatorRecursion
target console
runtime AgentRuntime 0.1
entry console main
error MainError
errorCase MainError Placeholder CSignedInt32

operation sumTo
input operation sumTo accumulator CSignedInt64
input operation sumTo remaining CSignedInt64
output operation sumTo Result CSignedInt64 Void
memory sumTo heap no
async sumTo no
purpose operation sumTo "Tail-recursive accumulator: when `remaining` reaches 0, return `accumulator`; otherwise sumTo(accumulator + remaining, remaining - 1)."
invariant operation sumTo "Computes sum(1..n) in O(n) recursion depth."
label startSumTo
storage module immutable zeroBase CSignedInt64 0
storage module immutable oneStep CSignedInt64 1
call doneCheckCall math.equalI64
argument doneCheckCall left CSignedInt64 remaining
argument doneCheckCall right I64 zeroBase
run doneCheckCall
bind value isDone Bool doneCheckCall
branch if condition isDone target baseCaseSumTo
call newAccumCall math.addI64
argument newAccumCall left I64 accumulator
argument newAccumCall right I64 remaining
run newAccumCall
bind value newAccumulator CSignedInt64 newAccumCall
call decRemainingCall math.subtractI64
argument decRemainingCall left CSignedInt64 remaining
argument decRemainingCall right CSignedInt64 oneStep
run decRemainingCall
bind value nextRemaining CSignedInt64 decRemainingCall
call recurseCall sumTo
argument recurseCall accumulator CSignedInt64 newAccumulator
argument recurseCall remaining CSignedInt64 nextRemaining
run recurseCall
bind ok recursiveResult CSignedInt64 recurseCall
return ok recursiveResult
label baseCaseSumTo
return ok accumulator

operation main
input operation main console Console
output operation main Result ExitCode MainError
effect main write console.stdout
memory main heap no
async main no
purpose operation main "sumTo(0, 10) == 0+10+9+...+1 == 55."
invariant operation main "Verifies a 2-arg recursive accumulator can reach a base case 10 levels deep."
label startMain
storage module immutable zeroAccum CSignedInt64 0
storage module immutable tenInitial CSignedInt64 10
call computeCall sumTo
argument computeCall accumulator CSignedInt64 zeroAccum
argument computeCall remaining CSignedInt64 tenInitial
run computeCall
bind ok computedSum CSignedInt64 computeCall
memory main mutable sumStorage I64 0
set memory sumStorage computedSum
call writeCall console.writeIntegerLine
argument writeCall console Console console
argument writeCall value I64 sumStorage
run writeCall
ignore void source writeCall
storage module immutable successfulExitCode ExitCode 0
return ok successfulExitCode
